### Health
GET http://localhost:8000/api/health

### Fetch a small PDB structure
POST http://localhost:8000/api/proteins/fetch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "1CRN"
}

### Store a SMILES ligand
POST http://localhost:8000/api/ligands
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Aspirin control",
  "smiles": "CC(=O)OC1=CC=CC=C1C(=O)O",
  "input_format": "smiles"
}

### Agent command
POST http://localhost:8000/api/agent/message
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Fetch PDB ID 1CRN",
  "ligand_smiles": null
}

